  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently the hand-tracking pinch gestures seem to only be allowed if the confidence level of the tracking for that finger is high enough (or something?). The little blue dots flicker in and out and thus it seems to miss 75% of the pinches. On top of this the threshold for how close the little dots need to be to each other before the command activates is way too precise. Especially on a quest 2/pro where the tracking isnt that accurate.\n\nI think a solution for this would be one or more sliders in the options that would control the sensitivity and/or increase the activation radius for the gestures.",
